This is a source-available license. It is not an open-source license as defined by the Open Source Initiative.

2. Permission to Use

You are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to:

(a) download and use official ClaimShift releases on private or public Minecraft servers, including monetized servers;
(b) create reasonable backup copies for your own use;
(c) modify configuration files, rules, messages, colors, formatting, and locale files for your own server;
(d) create and share configuration presets or translations that do not contain or redistribute ClaimShift source code or compiled binaries;
(e) inspect the publicly available source code for security review, learning, troubleshooting, and interoperability;
(f) create a repository fork solely for preparing contributions to the official ClaimShift project; and
(g) submit patches, pull requests, bug fixes, translations, or other contributions to the official ClaimShift project.

